Based on your project structure, a good `.gitignore` would be:

```
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Virtual environment
venv/
.venv/
env/
ENV/

# Environment variables
.env

# IDE / VS Code
.vscode/
.idea/

# Database
*.db
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Logs
*.log

# Testing / coverage
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Build / packaging
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# OS files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
```
